    schema:title "Product Owner – SDV Data Products (f/m/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/adsquare/product-owner-sdv-data-products-berlin-39938> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-produktmanager-pc-hardware-munchen-496183> a prov:Entity,
