    schema:title "(Senior) Projekt- und Prozessmanager Customer Activation (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/oxg-glasfaser-gmbh/remote-senior-projekt-und-prozessmanager-customer-activation-70909> .

