<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-sap-sd-consultant-developer-ai-integration-berlin-182883> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-25T04:44:23+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/workist-gmbh/sap-sd-consultant-developer-ai-integration-berlin-182883> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "31061e3480202fff949b8185c641e91828e4d432213a738820388cc56476b241" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-08-24T18:48:18+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-08-25T04:44:23+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "sap-sd-consultant-developer-ai-integration-berlin-182883" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-24"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Deine Rolle bei uns For our Solution Engineering team we're looking for an SAP SD developer/consultant. At Workist, our Solution Engineering team works directly with our customers to connect their ERP (e.g. sAP) systems to our AI platform and get them live as fast as possible. Our customers rely on Workist's AI software to automate core processes in Sales and Procurement. SAP is where the majority of that data lives, thus we need to tightly integrate with SAP. In this role you'll combine product engineering with hands-on project work, and you'll be the person who makes our SAP integration scale. Deine Aufgaben You own the SAP side of the Workist integration and are an important part of the customer journey, from the first technical workshop through go-live and beyond. You proactively identify process and product improvements. You develop, maintain and customise our SAP integration for S/4HANA and ECC customers You run and manage customer implementation projects, from requirements workshops to go-live You are the technical counterpart for our customers before and after signature, making sure our software is compatible with their existing SAP landscape and compliant with data protection requirements You work closely with our Product & Engineering team to align the SAP integration with our product roadmap You analyse and identify new use cases that create measurable value for our customers Dein Profil We're looking for you as a professional team player who feels at home in an agile working environment where we share knowledge and push each other to deliver the best possible result. You have at least 3 years of professional experience as an SAP developer or consultant You are proficient in ABAP and ABAP Objects, and have built both reports and complete packages You are confident with API technologies such as OData and REST You know what SE80 is and feel at home in it You have experience or a strong interest in working with AI to solve valuable business problems — an AI-first mindset You have excellent communication skills and solid project management skills You love developing yourself continuously, working independently and making your own decisions First experience with Python, OData service development or SAP BTP is a plus You speak fluent German and English (native or at least C1) Unsere Benefits & Kultur WorKi Tower: Our hip office in the heart of the city over 8 floors invites you to work professionally at an ergonomic workplace and gives you space for your creativity. Our own Workist Lounge awaits you with a cozy atmosphere including coffee, drinks and a vitamin basket for short or longer creative breaks. Play table tennis, darts or Nintendo to clear your head and exchange ideas with other teams. Flexible working hours: Shape your working day with our flexible working hours. Have important appointments in the morning or evening? No problem, take advantage of work schedule flexibility. Office, Remote & Workation: You decide yourself and have the flexible choice between a hip office or remote from your favorite location! We give you the freedom to work 4 weeks a year from abroad. Your state-of-the-art hardware will accompany you on your way! Come-Together: Let's play together - let's celebrate together! End the working day with a cool drink in our lounge or enjoy the time with your colleagues at the summer party, Christmas party or our quarterly team events. Stay fit & healthy: Your fitness is important to us, so join our weekly RunningLunch and connect with your colleagues. Work-life balance and reduction of your stress level included. Stay mobile: Choose between Deutschlandticket Job and a JobRad allowance and be mobile throughout Berlin and/or Germany. Be social: For your heart's project or to get involved in social and volunteer work, we support you with 3 additional \"Social Days\". Further your education - with a personal development budget of EUR 1,000.00 per year. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
