    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>About Energy Exemplar</strong></p> <p>In an era where the world is rapidly advancing towards a cleaner future through decarbonization, Energy Exemplar’s mission lies in ‘Empowering Transformative Energy Decisions’. Founded in 1999 in Adelaide, Australia, our award-winning software portfolio encompassing the modeling and simulation platform PLEXOS®, Aurora, and Adapt2, is trusted by innovative organizations across the globe. Through our technology and people, we strive to enable stakeholders from across the entire energy value chain to revolutionize the energy ecosystem and to collaboratively plan and execute for a sustainable energy future with unprecedented clarity, speed, and innovation.&nbsp;</p> <p>Our impact is global and is being recognized across the industry. Some of our recent accolades include:</p> <ul> <li><em>SaaS Company of the Year (2025) – Global Business Tech Awards.</em></li> <li><em>Environmental Impact Award (2025) – E+E Leaders Awards.</em></li> <li><em>IPPAI (Independent Power Producers Association of India) Power Awards (2025) - Winners</em></li> <li><em>Finalist: Platts Global Energy Awards (2024) – Grid Edge category</em></li> <li><em>Finalist: Reuters Global Energy Transition Awards (2024) – Technologies of Change</em></li> <li><em>Top 50 Marketing Team (2024) – Voted by the public at the ICON Awards.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>How We Work</strong></p> <p>Energy Exemplar is growing fast around 30% year on year and, that growth is driven by how we work. We trust our team to deliver great results from wherever they work best, whether that’s at home, in the office, or on the move.</p> <p>We’re a global team that values ownership, integrity, and innovation. You’ll be supported to balance work and life in a way that works for you, and empowered to take initiative, solve problems, and make an impact, regardless of your background, location, or role.</p> <p>Our four core values, Customer Success, One Global Team, Integrity &amp; Ownership, and Innovation Excellence aren’t just words. They show up in how we collaborate, how we solve, and how we grow together.</p></div><p><strong>About the Role</strong></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">As a member of the EMEA Solutions team at Energy Exemplar, this role is the bridge between our power trading customer base and the full capability of the PLEXOS platform. The ideal candidate combines deep expertise in fundamental energy market modelling with hands-on experience in trading desk workflows, and is equally comfortable scripting automated pipelines.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">This is a unique opportunity to work closely with trading organisations across EMEA, helping them unlock the full operational potential of PLEXOS and shaping how energy trading desks&nbsp;leverage&nbsp;fundamental modelling in their day-to-day decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">This role has three primary objectives:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <ol> <li data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Deliver tailored support and solutions for power trading customers and prospects</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">: Work collaboratively with customers to ensure PLEXOS meets the needs of trading desks, from pre-trade analysis to post-trade optimisation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Pre-Sales Technical Support</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">:&nbsp;Partner with the EMEA sales team to&nbsp;demonstrate&nbsp;the value of PLEXOS to prospective trading organisations. Responsibilities include delivering technical demonstrations tailored to trading desk use cases, responding to detailed functional and technical queries during the sales process, supporting proof-of-concept engagements, and contributing to thought leadership content that positions Energy Exemplar as the platform of choice for fundamental-model-driven trading.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Post-Sales Customer Success:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;Serve as a trusted technical point of contact for existing trading customers. Support onboarding, resolve modelling and workflow challenges, and work collaboratively with customers to ensure their PLEXOS deployment continues to meet the evolving needs of their trading operations. Act as the voice of the trading customer back into the Solutions team, surfacing recurring needs and improvement opportunities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ol> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Key Skills and Expertise</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The ideal candidate will have a background&nbsp;similar to&nbsp;a trading analyst, with practical experience in:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;64e98347-58c7-519f-918b-369ff2726dae|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469777841,&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,469769226,&quot;Century Gothic,Times New Roman&quot;,335551500,&quot;0&quot;,268442635,&quot;18&quot;,335559685,&quot;283&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,335559705,&quot;3081&quot;,335559739,&quot;60&quot;,335559738,&quot;60&quot;,469775450,&quot;SAW-Table List Bullet&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134234082,&quot;true&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;SAW-TableListBullet&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,335559682,&quot;8&quot;,335559683,&quot;0&quot;,469778324,&quot;SAW-Table Body&quot;,469777804,&quot;&quot;,469777803,&quot;left&quot;,469777815,&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;,335559693,&quot;-1&quot;,469769242,&quot;8226&quot;,335559991,&quot;283&quot;,536884268,&quot;{64e98347-58c7-519f-918b-369ff2726dae}{1}&quot;,335552541,&quot;1&quot;]}\">Working with fundamental (stack) market models to forecast power prices, cross-border flows, and supply-demand dynamics across short-, medium-, and long-term horizons.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Familiarity with trading desk operations and the tempo of intraday and day-ahead markets&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Strong scripting skills (Python or similar) for automation and workflow integration&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Comfort working with APIs, CLI tools, and cloud-based computation environments</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Applying market models to support pre-trade decisions, including physical energy trading and proprietary trading.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Understanding how trading desks use modelling outputs to optimise market positions, assess risk, and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">identify</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">&nbsp;arbitrage opportunities.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Using modelling to evaluate Value at Risk (</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">VaR</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">), inform hedging strategies, and optimise portfolio performance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&quot;335559991&quot;:283,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"SAW-Table List Bullet\">Supporting strategies for participation in secondary markets (Balancing Markets, Ancillary Services, Capacity Markets, etc.).</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:283,&quot;335559693&quot;:-1,&q