    schema:title "Team Lead (f/m/x) Content Operations – France" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/bonial-international-gmbh/team-lead-content-operations-france-berlin-443433> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-teamlead-sea-google-ads-vollzeit-munich-153230> a prov:Entity,
