    schema:title "Werkstudent Sales Development (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/comdesk-gmbh/werkstudent-sales-development-munchen-299612> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudent-social-media-marketing-berlin-152364> a prov:Entity,
